{"type": "text", "id": "card_head", "x": 102, "y": 556, "text": "#1237 · Dan Adler, Sourcegraph · 00:03:00–00:03:25", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#fdba74"},
{"type": "text", "id": "card_body", "x": 102, "y": 592, "text": "\"...that keep the world running are beginning\n to decay.\"\n\n\"way too much to fit into a context window or\n even just to clone and GP in real time.\"\n\n\"different coding standards being applied in\n different places by different agents across\n the codebase.\"", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#f5ede4"},
{"type": "ellipse", "id": "claim", "x": 980, "y": 600, "width": 420, "height": 130, "backgroundColor": "#ea580c", "strokeColor": "#9a3412", "strokeWidth": 2, "fillStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "label": {"text": "Every change is fine.\nThe whole is not.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#ffffff"}},
{"type": "text", "id": "cite", "x": 80, "y": 820, "text": "Source: #1237 — Dan Adler, Sourcegraph (claims#31)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#475569"}
